\title{PhysioGaitNorm: Normative Gait Reference Database for the Physio Ecosystem}
\description{
Normative gait reference data for the Physio ecosystem: mean and standard-deviation kinematic waveform bands over the gait cycle (51- and 101-point) for the nine Gait Deviation Index / Gait Profile Score kinematic variables, together with a normative feature reference set for constructing the Gait Deviation Index. Provides dataset loaders, a catalogue, and a documented provenance and version manifest. The bundled "adult_reference" set is a representative healthy-adult normative model derived from published normal gait kinematics (Perry & Burnfield; Winter; Kadaba et al.) with a synthetic normative feature population; see the provenance manifest and citations. Consumed by gait-index calculations (Schwartz & Rozumalski 2008 GDI; Baker et al. 2009 GPS/GVS/MAP).
